    "chunk_text": "ade. \u00c6fter \u00feam Diocle feng Astiai to rice, se n\u00e6fde nanne sunu; ac he nam his nefan him to suna of Se \u00fea, mid \u00f0on \u00fee he geweox, him \u00fea of\u00feyncendum & \u00f0\u00e6m Perseum \u00fe\u00e6t hie on his eames He \u00fea Astiai se cyning be\u00feohte swi\u00f0ost to Arpelles his ealdormenn, \u00fe\u00e6t he mid his cr\u00e6fte his He \u00fea se ealdormon mid firde for ongean \u00fe\u00e6m Perseum, & sona \u00fe\u00e6s folces \u00feone m\u00e6stan d\u00e6l & on \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte Me\u00f0a cr\u00e6ft & heora dugu\u00f0 gefeoll. \u00dea se cyning \u00fe\u00e6t facn anfunde \u00fee se ealdormon wi\u00fe hiene gedon h\u00e6fde, he \u00feeah gegaderade \u00feone & he Cirus Persea cyning h\u00e6fde \u00feriddan d\u00e6l his firde be\u00e6ftan him, on \u00fe\u00e6t gerad, gif \u00e6nig w\u00e6re \u00dea \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0re gebyrede him \u00fe\u00e6t hie hw\u00e6thwara gebugan to fleonne. Hi \u00fea hiera wif him ongean iernende w\u00e6ron, & hie swi\u00fee tornwyrdon, & acsedon, gif hie feohtan Hi \u00fea hr\u00e6dlice, \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee \u00fea wif hie swa scondlice ger\u00e6ht h\u00e6fdon, gewendan eft ongean He \u00fea Cirus ageaf \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge his eame ealle \u00fea are \u00fee he \u00e6r h\u00e6fde, buton \u00f0\u00e6t he cyning n\u00e6re; Ac him Cirus his nefa gesealde Ircaniam \u00fea \u00feeode on anwald to habbanne. \u00d0\u00e6r wear\u00f0 M\u00e6\u00f0e onwald geendod. Ac Cirus mid Perseum to \u00f0\u00e6m anwalde feng. Ac \u00fea byrig \u00fee on monegum \u00feeodum M\u00e6\u00f0",
